        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 25 at 3:26AM MDT until September 25 at 3:30AM MDT by NWS El Paso Tx/Santa Teresa NM</headline>
        <description>Flood waters have receded, but areas of standing water remain. Please
continue to heed remaining road closures.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 600 AM MDT for a portion of
southwest Texas.
